+
+#### [EasyOCR](https://github.com/JaidedAI/EasyOCR)
+> **Description:** EasyOCR is a ready-to-use OCR library that focuses on fast setup, broad language support, and practical text extraction from images and PDFs. Its README highlights support for 80+ languages and a simple API, which makes it attractive for accounting teams that want a lightweight extractor for receipts, expense images, and vendor documents before passing the text into classification or reconciliation logic. It is less specialized than a full document-intelligence stack, but it is easy to prototype with and widely adopted in finance-adjacent automations. GitHub metadata: last commit date Dec 5, 2025, about 31k stars, primary language Python, license Apache-2.0.
