+### Invoice and Table Extraction
+
+#### [invoice2data](https://github.com/invoice-x/invoice2data)
+> **Description:** invoice2data is one of the clearest open-source fits for accounting operations because it is purpose-built to extract structured fields from invoices. The README explains template-based extraction from PDFs, images, and OCR text, with support for standard invoice fields and custom templates. That makes it practical for accounts payable automation, vendor normalization, and document-to-CSV conversion when the document mix is repetitive enough to benefit from rules. It is not the fanciest model-driven system, but its transparency and maintainability are advantages in finance teams that care about reproducibility. GitHub metadata: last commit date Nov 17, 2025, about 2.3k stars, primary language Python, license MIT.
