+#### [Darts](https://github.com/unit8co/darts)
+> **Description:** Darts is a Python library for easy manipulation and forecasting of time series. The README emphasizes a unified interface across classical statistical models and deep-learning approaches, which is useful for finance teams comparing forecasting methods without rewriting their whole stack. In accounting contexts, it can support revenue, cash-flow, expense, headcount, and collections forecasting. Darts is not finance-specific, but its model breadth and production-friendly API make it one of the stronger open-source choices for FP&A and scenario modeling teams. GitHub metadata: last commit date Nov 27, 2025, about 10k stars, primary language Python, license Apache-2.0.
